# SIREN contract (agents)

- Read `docs/CONTRACT.md` before structural changes; `docs/VOICE.md` before copy.
- `collector/`, `site/`, receipts, `agent-kit/`: Node 20 built-ins only — no `node_modules` imports.
- Network only via `collector/fetch.mjs` (except documented posting exception).
- No secrets in git or `site/`. Do not casually rewrite `data/reference.json`.
- Index is activity tempo, not doom probability or forecast.
- Prefer verify skills/commands in `CLAUDE.md` / `.claude/skills/siren-verify`.
